range c766f44f..adef82bf
Review of `2026-09-26-init-commits-the-lock` (branch diff against `develop`, 7 non-plan files). I found 10 candidates, ranked most severe first. Per the recipe, I only removed duplicates and did not verify them. Two things I did check: the repo's copy and the pack's copy of `setup/mise` are byte-identical, and `mise ls --current --local` does resolve pins that live in the `conf.d` files.

